  <name>Cliplin</name>
  <summary>Lightweight clipboard history manager</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Cliplin sits quietly in your system tray and keeps track of your last 30 clipboard entries,
      most-recently-used first, so you can quickly retrieve text you copied recently.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Keeps last 30 clipboard entries (text only)</li>
      <li>Most-recently-used reordering</li>
      <li>System tray drop-down menu for click-to-copy</li>
      <li>Persistent local storage</li>
      <li>One-click Clear History</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
